<%#
  Pager for the album's photo grid.

  Its own partial with its own turbo_stream target: adding or removing a photo
  can change the number of pages, and a pager left behind by the previous render
  offers links to a page that no longer exists.

  Locals: album, page, total_pages
%>
<%= render "shared/pager",
           page: page,
           total_pages: total_pages,
           path_for_page: ->(n) { album_path(album, album_view_params(page: n)) } %>
